# P5-US-U5: no bill is asked for. Two turns whose streams name their
# generation and no cost (p5-usage-deferred-turns.json: fx c1db919's
# `.deferred`, which it and the ledger xfx asked the Gateway for by id with
# GET /v1/generation?id=<gen>, src/gateway/client.zig:285-372@c1db9191), then
# /usage, an exit and a resume of the session, a third such turn, and /usage
# again. fx v0.0.16 asks no generation (a41fc2d4); neither does xfx since U5.
# `gwlog` keeps every request the fake was asked, GET /v1/generation included.
models models.json
gateway p5-usage-deferred-turns.json
wait 2.5
type first question
key Enter
wait 3
type second question
key Enter
wait 3
snap turns
type /usage
key Enter
wait 2
snap usage
key Escape
wait 0.5
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 4
snap resumed
type third question
key Enter
wait 3
type /usage
key Enter
wait 2
snap usage-resumed
key Escape
wait 0.5
gwlog
